/E (This is a very interesting question and one that I have been pondering lately. I registered a company some time ago in order to offer BTC payment services to merchants, but the only way to do that is to KYC your clients and get a compliance officer etc. I really do not want to do all of that, simply because it goes against my own principles and all of what BTC is supposed to solve. I thought it wouldn't be so hard and that complying would open me doors to financing, sponsors and all that, but the cost overhead is so huge that I finally ditched that path.)
